From: Sonali Naresh <sonanare@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:35:17 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] WPS PBS fixes for CERT WFA

For Independent Repeater mode, it is expected for the AP
vaps to be in UP state. Hence invoking the script during
dev_reset_default to clear the wireless file and bring up
1 AP and 1 STA vap per radio.

Initial implementation of dev_reset_default would teardown
all the vaps leading to WPS PBC failure.

Signed-off-by: Sonali Naresh <sonanare@qti.qualcomm.com>
